  "notes": "M4250 series common platform: 16K MAC addresses, 4K ARP/NDP entries, 4K VLANs, static routes (894 IPv4 / 126 IPv6) plus RIP (32 IPv4), DHCP server (2K leases), sFlow, SNMP, console/telnet/SSH CLI and the AV web GUI. Multi-gigabit tile model with no PoE at all: the twelve copper ports are 100M/1G/2.5G and the datasheet lists no PoE budget for it, so it is not an option for a PoE tile wall. 1U and only 100 mm deep. The datasheet specification table attributes this box an ARM A9 1.25 GHz CPU with 2 GB RAM. Sources: datasheet https://www.downloads.netgear.com/files/GDC/M4250/M4250_Datasheet.pdf and https://kb.netgear.com/000064904/NETGEAR-AV-Line-of-Fully-Managed-Switches-M4250-Series."
